WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.540
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.710 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.710
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.880 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.330 --> 01:50.540
A SINGLE SHARD OF COURAGE

01:52.840 --> 01:56.340
Beast King Anguish Blast!

02:02.470 --> 02:04.470
Victory is mine!

02:06.520 --> 02:10.150
What's that?
Could it be Dai and Maam...

02:10.310 --> 02:11.860
No. It's not my concern!

02:12.860 --> 02:16.900
It's not my business anymore
whether they live or die!

02:17.070 --> 02:18.950
You're still here?

02:20.070 --> 02:24.410
Oh, you're the Mage
from the fake Hero's party.

02:24.580 --> 02:25.830
The name's Masopho.

02:28.330 --> 02:30.210
You're nothing but a looter!

02:33.920 --> 02:36.340
Would you like to join us?

02:36.510 --> 02:39.130
You seem to have a lot of potential.

02:39.590 --> 02:43.470
Don't be stupid!
I'm a student of Avan, the Hero!

02:43.600 --> 02:46.350
I'm not a small-time crook like you guys!

02:46.520 --> 02:50.350
Oh really?
So does the famous Avan

02:50.520 --> 02:53.980
make students of people
who abandon their companions?

02:54.940 --> 02:57.570
Here. Let me show you.

03:01.910 --> 03:03.780
Dai?! Old man Brass?!

03:03.950 --> 03:05.160
Why?!

03:12.080 --> 03:14.080
So you survived.

03:18.260 --> 03:19.170
Dai...

03:25.100 --> 03:26.220
I'll heal you.

03:29.680 --> 03:30.730
Maam!

03:30.890 --> 03:33.400
It looks like they're in trouble.

03:33.560 --> 03:36.730
Somebody should help them.

03:37.480 --> 03:41.150
But, even if I go,
what can I do against Crocodine?

03:41.950 --> 03:43.610
Dammit!

03:46.740 --> 03:49.790
"A Hero is one with courage!

03:52.000 --> 03:54.920
And true courage is not planned!

03:55.080 --> 04:00.210
True courage does not depend
on the strength of one's foes!"

04:05.140 --> 04:06.390
Like that?

04:06.550 --> 04:09.720
They're not my words.
They were my master's.

04:09.890 --> 04:10.850
Your master?

04:11.020 --> 04:16.940
When I was young, I trained to be
a Mage to fight for justice.

04:18.020 --> 04:19.820
But I couldn't hack it.

04:19.980 --> 04:23.700
I would often abandon my companions
and run away from danger.

04:23.860 --> 04:26.200
And just look at me now.

04:27.320 --> 04:28.280
Old man...

04:28.450 --> 04:30.160
Now, hurry on!

04:30.330 --> 04:34.960
While there's still a single shard
of courage left within you.

04:40.250 --> 04:42.300
<i>You disgust me!</i>

04:48.930 --> 04:50.600
<i>I am disgusting!</i>

04:50.760 --> 04:54.230
<i>All I do is think of myself and run away!</i>

04:55.480 --> 05:00.150
<i>While Master Avan and Dai
always risked their lives to fight!</i>

05:00.320 --> 05:02.820
Well, that kid's dead.

05:02.990 --> 05:04.650
Poor thing.

05:04.820 --> 05:07.160
Oh, he'll be fine.

05:07.450 --> 05:10.370
That boy is a student of Avan.

05:10.530 --> 05:13.290
Avan?! You mean the real Hero?!

05:14.330 --> 05:17.290
He's made of different stuff than us.

05:25.630 --> 05:27.260
A Heyedra.

05:29.850 --> 05:30.720
Zaboera!

05:31.260 --> 05:36.560
<i>She won't get in your way now.
Go ahead and finish Dai.</i>

05:42.690 --> 05:43.860
Somebody...

05:44.320 --> 05:45.190
save Dai...!

05:51.080 --> 05:53.620
Now, it will finally end...

05:53.790 --> 05:55.870
with this blow!

05:56.040 --> 05:57.460
Dai!

05:57.620 --> 05:58.420
Farewell!

05:58.580 --> 05:59.670
Stop!

06:08.430 --> 06:09.180
Popp?!

06:09.470 --> 06:11.800
Ah, the Mage from before.

06:11.970 --> 06:15.770
What can someone like you
possibly do by showing up now?

06:16.680 --> 06:17.600
Begone!

06:21.940 --> 06:26.860
<i>Master Avan, one fifth,
no, one tenth of what you had is enough.</i>

06:27.030 --> 06:29.240
<i>Lend me your courage!</i>

06:32.620 --> 06:33.780
How dare you!

06:33.950 --> 06:35.080
What?!

06:35.410 --> 06:40.330
You hurt my friends! How dare you?!

06:41.880 --> 06:45.670
Boy, do you know what you're saying?

06:45.960 --> 06:47.420
S-Sure!

06:47.720 --> 06:51.090
I'm saying I'm going to beat you!

06:51.260 --> 06:52.800
You dumb lizard!

06:52.970 --> 06:56.720
Popp! Don't attack that Lump Shaman!

06:56.890 --> 06:57.680
He's...

06:57.850 --> 07:00.980
I know! I recognize him!

07:01.150 --> 07:04.860
You kidnapped him from the island
and turned him into your servant!

07:05.020 --> 07:06.440
You dirty fiends!

07:07.070 --> 07:09.610
Get Crocodine's Magic Cylinder...!

07:10.450 --> 07:11.240
Maam!

07:11.410 --> 07:13.200
Go on and run away.

07:13.370 --> 07:17.330
Compared to Dai,
you're nothing but a gutless worm!

07:17.490 --> 07:20.290
Leave now and I'll spare you.

07:22.290 --> 07:26.170
Screw that!
I'm never abandoning my friends!

07:26.340 --> 07:28.630
Avan didn't train any cowards!

07:28.800 --> 07:29.800
Popp!

07:30.130 --> 07:33.470
Crocodine! Fight me one on one!

07:33.640 --> 07:35.100
A puny ant like you...

07:35.680 --> 07:41.390
Or are you going to use a hostage
against a gutless worm like me?!

07:41.560 --> 07:42.560
What?!

07:42.730 --> 07:45.310
I guess you're a worm, too!
You dumb lizard!

07:45.480 --> 07:51.530
Very well! If it's death you seek, you can
go with your friends to the afterlife!

07:51.700 --> 07:54.450
Brass! Stay out of this!

07:55.030 --> 07:58.910
<i>Good. Now I can fight
without worrying about him.</i>

07:59.080 --> 08:01.160
<i>Let's see if my best spell will work.</i>

08:10.460 --> 08:11.670
Here I come!

08:30.030 --> 08:31.780
You distanced yourself.

08:31.940 --> 08:35.450
Unlike Heroes and Warriors, Mages like you

08:35.610 --> 08:39.160
are physically no different
from normal humans.

08:39.660 --> 08:42.290
One blow from me will kill you.

08:44.000 --> 08:49.800
Now it depends on whether the spell
you want to cast will work!

08:51.170 --> 08:54.720
See for yourself
whether it'll work or not!

09:01.220 --> 09:02.930
Kafrizz!

09:05.060 --> 09:05.810
Did it work?!

09:13.320 --> 09:15.820
Even if you are a worm,
you're Avan's student.

09:16.530 --> 09:20.240
I didn't expect
you to be able to cast Kafrizz!

09:20.580 --> 09:21.910
Unfortunately...

09:23.080 --> 09:26.920
I created a shield of wind
with my Vortex Axe,

09:27.080 --> 09:29.000
and avoided a direct hit!

09:34.760 --> 09:38.510
I hope you're ready, boy!

09:55.360 --> 09:56.780
And that's that.

09:57.240 --> 09:59.570
<i>It hurts! It hurts so bad!</i>

09:59.740 --> 10:01.950
<i>I'm... done for!</i>

10:02.870 --> 10:04.750
P-Popp...

10:04.910 --> 10:06.830
Run... Popp...

10:07.790 --> 10:09.000
Dai?!

10:09.380 --> 10:11.840
<i>Don't worry, Dai.</i>

10:12.420 --> 10:14.550
<i>I'm not running anymore!</i>

10:17.590 --> 10:24.140
<i>You kept fighting
after taking tons of blows like this!</i>

10:27.520 --> 10:34.320
I can't be lying down
after just one or two!

10:34.650 --> 10:35.900
You can stand?!

10:40.030 --> 10:43.370
<i>I'll just have to sacrifice myself
and do what I can!</i>

10:43.530 --> 10:46.870
<i>Maybe I can't bring it
to a stalemate like Master Avan, but...</i>

10:47.160 --> 10:49.920
<i>Wait... Like Master Avan?</i>

10:50.710 --> 10:54.000
<i>I've never done it before,
but I'll have to try!</i>

11:05.260 --> 11:07.560
Have you lost your mind?

11:15.440 --> 11:16.860
What are you doing?

11:33.460 --> 11:35.250
Why do you endure?!

11:35.420 --> 11:40.220
What can you do with your rod shattered
and your Magic Power spent?!

11:45.180 --> 11:46.560
What's so funny?!

11:47.180 --> 11:49.430
It's all planned out.

11:49.600 --> 11:53.690
Shattering my rod
and saving my Magic Power...

11:53.850 --> 11:54.520
What?!

11:57.190 --> 12:01.610
Watch the legendary spell
my master, Avan, excelled at!

12:05.530 --> 12:06.780
A magic circle?!

12:07.200 --> 12:09.830
Dark influence, begone!

12:10.000 --> 12:12.620
Glimmer!

12:20.010 --> 12:22.510
AVAN STRASH

12:25.050 --> 12:27.510
BEAST KING ANGUISH BLAST

12:45.110 --> 12:46.280
Huh? What?

12:47.280 --> 12:49.660
I did... it!

12:49.830 --> 12:50.700
What?!

12:50.870 --> 12:51.870
Impossible!

12:52.040 --> 12:55.120
Where am I?
What happened to me?

12:58.170 --> 12:59.210
Old man...

13:00.050 --> 13:00.920
Popp?!

13:01.170 --> 13:04.720
You were under the Dark Army's control.

13:04.880 --> 13:08.550
It was a dirty plot
to use you against Dai.

13:08.720 --> 13:12.680
Listen, you can't leave that magic circle!

13:12.850 --> 13:14.690
Use me against Dai?!

13:15.940 --> 13:17.310
Did I...?!

13:17.480 --> 13:18.690
Curse you!

13:21.820 --> 13:22.940
What is this?!

13:24.400 --> 13:26.610
You, boy!

13:28.240 --> 13:30.870
What have you done?!

13:31.450 --> 13:32.790
Glimmer.

13:33.790 --> 13:38.500
It's a spell that creates
a magic circle that repels evil.

13:38.830 --> 13:42.090
I can't cover an entire island
like Master Avan, though.

13:42.250 --> 13:46.880
Fool! What point is there
in saving Brass now?

13:49.350 --> 13:56.140
Look. You used a major spell
beyond your abilities and you're spent.

14:01.400 --> 14:03.070
It doesn't matter.

14:03.610 --> 14:06.200
Dai's still... Dai's still here.

14:06.360 --> 14:07.570
Dai?!

14:07.740 --> 14:11.700
If old man Brass is okay,
then Dai can fight freely.

14:12.580 --> 14:15.250
He'll take care of you easily.

14:15.410 --> 14:18.080
He's really strong.

14:19.040 --> 14:23.380
You were willing
to sacrifice yourself for Dai?!

14:23.550 --> 14:26.050
It's nothing noble like that.

14:26.800 --> 14:29.220
It's not like I want to die.

14:30.340 --> 14:31.470
But...

14:32.010 --> 14:34.930
I've still got my pride.

14:35.100 --> 14:39.190
To live on after having
abandoned my friends...

14:39.810 --> 14:42.900
I just thought that would be
more pathetic than dying!

14:45.320 --> 14:46.650
<i>Master Avan...</i>

14:47.610 --> 14:49.360
Besides, Popp,

14:49.530 --> 14:55.120
I believe the power we gain through
training should be used to help others.

14:55.540 --> 14:56.700
<i>Master...</i>

14:57.330 --> 14:59.250
<i>I think I get it now.</i>

15:00.170 --> 15:02.750
<i>I'm sorry it took so long.</i>

15:03.590 --> 15:07.920
<i>This fledgling of a boy
is risking his life to fight.</i>

15:08.340 --> 15:10.010
<i>And yet, look at me.</i>

15:10.180 --> 15:15.010
<i>I abandoned my pride out of fear
and resorted to dirty schemes.</i>

15:15.810 --> 15:18.180
<i>Is this truly the right way?</i>

15:18.350 --> 15:22.150
<i>What is victory worth
if it's at the cost of my pride?</i>

15:22.310 --> 15:24.690
<i>Dammit, Crocodine!</i>

15:25.480 --> 15:30.030
<i>What are you doing?!
Kill the boy already!</i>

15:31.280 --> 15:33.450
<i>Victory is at hand!</i>

15:33.620 --> 15:39.000
<i>Do you want to lose your seat as
Legion Commander over feelings of mercy?!</i>

15:46.500 --> 15:49.470
Popp, run! Get out of here!

15:49.630 --> 15:51.880
I can't even stand up.

15:52.220 --> 15:55.100
Don't! Stay inside the magic circle!

15:56.010 --> 16:01.100
If you step out of there,
all my hard work will be for nothing.

16:01.270 --> 16:06.770
It's a tiny magic circle,
but it contains all of my Magic Power.

16:07.270 --> 16:08.690
Popp...

16:22.790 --> 16:24.960
Don't! Don't do it!

16:28.420 --> 16:29.920
Forgive me, boy.

16:45.060 --> 16:46.310
Popp!

16:51.320 --> 16:52.070
What?!

16:55.070 --> 16:58.080
He stands?! But Dai was all but finished!

16:58.240 --> 17:00.620
And what is this light?!

17:01.620 --> 17:02.450
What?!

17:05.420 --> 17:06.880
It's a miracle!

17:07.170 --> 17:10.130
Crocodine, you'll pay for that.

17:10.840 --> 17:15.930
You used my Grampa for evil
and hurt my friends.

17:18.470 --> 17:20.310
You'll pay for that!

17:23.600 --> 17:26.190
What is this light?!

17:33.110 --> 17:34.190
Maam!

17:35.530 --> 17:38.490
What's that mark?! And this light?!

17:50.790 --> 17:51.550
Come on!

17:51.710 --> 17:53.050
Enough of this!

17:53.210 --> 17:54.510
Take this!

17:57.220 --> 17:58.220
Impossible!

18:12.940 --> 18:14.900
Maam! Hang in there!

18:15.070 --> 18:16.110
Popp...

18:16.530 --> 18:18.660
What is that power?

18:18.820 --> 18:20.450
I don't know.

18:20.620 --> 18:23.450
It must be some hidden power of his.

18:24.160 --> 18:28.920
I think that strange mark
responds to Dai's anger.

18:30.000 --> 18:33.460
And right now, Dai is truly angry.

18:34.590 --> 18:39.050
His anger is exploding
at the Dark Army's dirty schemes!

18:39.220 --> 18:44.930
<i>Is this Dai's true power that
forced Lord Hadlar to retreat?</i>

18:45.720 --> 18:47.560
<i>I can't lose here!</i>

18:47.730 --> 18:53.270
<i>If I lose, what did I
throw my pride away for?</i>

18:53.940 --> 18:58.740
I must win even if it kills me!

18:58.900 --> 19:00.450
Beast King Anguish Blast!

19:00.610 --> 19:02.830
Oh no! Dai's unarmed!

19:05.040 --> 19:08.040
Here's a Heal. You should be able to run.

19:08.580 --> 19:09.460
Help Dai!

19:09.620 --> 19:10.540
Right!

19:17.840 --> 19:21.680
Your body may be like steel,

19:21.840 --> 19:24.810
but at close range, this will end you!

19:24.970 --> 19:28.480
With my greatest, most powerful attack,
I send you to the afterlife!

19:28.640 --> 19:29.640
Dai!

19:31.480 --> 19:34.730
Use this!

19:39.030 --> 19:42.280
Do it, Dai! The attack of our master!

19:46.120 --> 19:50.290
Beast King Anguish Blast!

19:51.290 --> 19:57.800
Avan Strash!

20:15.650 --> 20:18.230
Avan Strash, is it?

20:19.360 --> 20:21.360
An impressive attack.

20:21.530 --> 20:23.450
You... win!

20:27.530 --> 20:28.450
Yes!

20:31.870 --> 20:36.750
If losing was my fate,
I wish I'd fought you fair and square.

20:36.920 --> 20:37.920
Crocodine?

20:38.090 --> 20:39.050
You, boy!

20:39.840 --> 20:42.260
You taught me a lesson...

20:42.420 --> 20:45.550
on how valuable pride really is.

20:46.100 --> 20:51.480
If my defeat is by ones
such as you, I have no regrets.

20:51.640 --> 20:53.810
In fact, I'm proud.

20:54.270 --> 20:56.980
I was obsessed with victory.

20:57.980 --> 20:59.650
I was a fool!

21:05.410 --> 21:07.200
Farewell, Dai.

21:08.830 --> 21:10.540
Don't ever lose.

21:10.700 --> 21:13.540
A Hero must always be strong!

21:33.810 --> 21:36.310
That idiot Crocodine. He lost.

21:36.690 --> 21:40.940
<i>But what was that astonishing power?</i>

21:41.110 --> 21:43.150
<i>And that mark?</i>

21:43.320 --> 21:46.660
<i>I must inform Lord Hadlar
of the situation.</i>

21:48.370 --> 21:49.700
<i>Crocodine...</i>

21:50.530 --> 21:51.240
Dai.

21:51.580 --> 21:52.580
You won!

22:20.190 --> 22:25.940
<i>Kindness is the magic of kind people</i>

22:20.190 --> 22:25.940
<i>yasashisa wa yasashii hito ga tsukaeru mahou</i>

22:26.110 --> 22:32.950
<i>Then do I have no choice
But to just be a normal person?</i>

22:26.110 --> 22:32.950
<i>jaa boku wa tada no hito de iru shikanaino?</i>

22:33.120 --> 22:36.160
<i>I'm not sure</i>

22:33.120 --> 22:36.160
<i>doudarou</i>

22:38.460 --> 22:44.130
<i>Even if the place I call home may change</i>

22:38.460 --> 22:44.130
<i>kaeru basho wa ne kawatte yuku kedo</i>

22:44.300 --> 22:46.670
<i>Listen to me, Mother</i>

22:44.300 --> 22:46.670
<i>naa kaasan boku wa</i>

22:46.840 --> 22:52.810
<i>I will never change those I protect</i>

22:46.840 --> 22:52.810
<i>mamoru hito wo kaetari shinai</i>

22:53.260 --> 22:57.480
<i>I wonder what you'd say</i>

22:53.260 --> 22:57.480
<i>anata wa nannte iukana</i>

22:57.640 --> 23:01.690
<i>At times I can be cowardly and small</i>

22:57.640 --> 23:01.690
<i>tokiyori yowaki de chippoke de</i>

23:01.860 --> 23:08.150
<i>What would you say to me
As I hesitate to even hesitate?</i>

23:01.860 --> 23:08.150
<i>mayou koto ni mo mayou boku ni nannte iukana</i>

23:08.320 --> 23:13.990
<i>Unlike the today that I sought</i>

23:08.320 --> 23:13.990
<i>sagashite ita kyou to chigatte</i>

23:14.160 --> 23:19.290
<i>I'm sure you'd laugh at my disappointment</i>

23:14.160 --> 23:19.290
<i>ochikonnde shimau boku wo warau no darou</i>

23:34.180 --> 23:39.100
<i>Having defeated the Beast King Crocodine,
Dai and friends head to Papnica Kingdom.</i>

23:39.270 --> 23:41.900
<i>There, they learn a terrible truth.</i>

23:42.060 --> 23:47.070
<i>On their way to Leona, the party
is surrounded by undead monsters.</i>

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
<i>Just then, a mysterious man
carrying an ominous sword appears.</i>

